== 1.10 Chapter 1 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Which of the following metals occurs in the free state in nature?],
  [copper],
  [iron],
  [aluminium],
  [gold]
)

#mcq(2, [The chief ore of aluminium is],
